// The Windows launcher's resources: its manifest (windows.manifest), as
// resource 1 (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID) of type 24
// (RT_MANIFEST), which Windows reads when it starts the program.
1 24 "windows.manifest"
